<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs $0.50-1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs $0.50-1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50-1.00 higher. Demand moderate to good for a moderate run.</p>
<p>Top $57.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2   230-260 lbs. 56.00-57.00, few 57.50.</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to 1.00 higher. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-400 lbs. 42.00-45.00</p>
<p>	   400-500 lbs. 43.00-45.00, few 47.00</p>
<p>	   500-600 lbs. 46.00-47.00, few 48.00</p>
<p>Few over 600 lbs. 48.00-49.00</p>
</text>
